publicKeyHash.description:
UUID derived from public key
Steps to create:
  1. Calculate SHA512 base64 hash of the public key
  2. Generate a v5 uuid using the namespace value: "f25d4515-fea7-44c7-8baf-f3ca50865e66" and the name value of the result of step 1

Example implementation in TypeScript
###
import { createHash } from 'crypto';
import { v5 as uuid } from 'uuid';

/**
 * Given a string value, return hash in the form of a uuid.
 *
 * @param value to hash
 */
function hash(value: string): string {
  return uuid(
    createHash('sha512')
    .update(value)
    .digest('base64'),
    'f25d4515-fea7-44c7-8baf-f3ca50865e66' // global namespace
  );
}
###
The public @checkdigit/hash npm package may be used to generate the hash value as well.

